WEBVTT

01:26.250 --> 01:31.930
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.200 --> 01:39.560
[Episode 8: The Su Family Is in Danger]

02:04.090 --> 02:05.586
I have nothing else I can welcome you with.

02:05.610 --> 02:07.386
This is the mung bean cake I made this noon.

02:07.410 --> 02:08.870
Have a taste.

02:10.200 --> 02:11.650
Thank you.

02:27.260 --> 02:30.436
The mung bean cake you made is different from that sold in the shop.

02:30.460 --> 02:31.980
What special ingredient did you use?

02:36.020 --> 02:38.086
Nothing special. Just the usual ingredients.

02:38.110 --> 02:39.616
You have to take care of so many children.

02:39.640 --> 02:41.960
Yet you had time to make mung cake at noon?

02:42.270 --> 02:45.510
I have a knack for time management.

02:46.900 --> 02:48.350
In the past two years,

02:48.420 --> 02:50.780
how much money has Jishan Hall received?

02:51.760 --> 02:54.986
I don't know the total number.

02:55.010 --> 02:56.526
But every amount of money

02:56.550 --> 02:57.986
is clearly recorded.

02:58.010 --> 03:00.020
You've just checked the books.

03:00.470 --> 03:02.276
Three months ago,

03:02.300 --> 03:05.396
Jin alone sent 60 taels of silver.

03:05.420 --> 03:06.846
Considering current prices, this amount of money

03:06.870 --> 03:09.686
can cover one year's expenditure of an average family.

03:09.710 --> 03:13.630
But you used all that money in one month.

03:14.610 --> 03:18.260
The money that Jin risked his life to earn

03:18.670 --> 03:20.550
was entrusted to the wrong person.

03:25.550 --> 03:27.000
What are the kids?

03:54.210 --> 03:55.910
Why are you hiding like a coward?

03:55.950 --> 03:58.109
Come out and fight with me.

04:08.210 --> 04:09.690
Hand over the kids.

04:10.560 --> 04:12.360
Then I might spare your life.

04:12.550 --> 04:14.456
You got paid. You need to do your job.

04:14.480 --> 04:16.056
I've paid you.

04:16.080 --> 04:17.739
Don't come any closer.

04:47.049 --> 04:48.650
Everyone man I kill

04:49.490 --> 04:52.650
is worth 10 taels of gold.

05:00.350 --> 05:02.700
You are going to pay for that.

05:18.910 --> 05:20.550
Let me guess,

05:21.770 --> 05:24.360
every time a donator found something wrong,

05:24.430 --> 05:26.180
you would take them to the backyard

05:26.430 --> 05:28.876
and kill them, just like what you did to Jin.

05:28.900 --> 05:29.766
Miss.

05:29.790 --> 05:31.096
You are breathless.

05:31.120 --> 05:33.080
You must be badly injured.

05:33.390 --> 05:36.150
You are really unlucky today.

05:36.810 --> 05:39.140
Jin is in a bad mood today.

05:39.840 --> 05:41.590
I'm in an even worse mood.

05:43.090 --> 05:45.110
You are talking nonsense,

05:48.110 --> 05:50.310
waiting for the poison to take effect, right?

05:51.410 --> 05:52.525
You...

05:52.549 --> 05:53.846
You...

05:53.870 --> 05:55.556
What a hypocrite!

05:55.580 --> 05:57.400
Why are you so nosy?

06:08.230 --> 06:09.230
What is the poison on the blade?

06:09.230 --> 06:10.086
It smells so bad.

06:10.110 --> 06:11.940
You can try it yourself.

06:31.290 --> 06:34.330
Dragon series poison. Swimming Dragon?

07:20.530 --> 07:23.420
20 taels of gold for two people.

07:41.240 --> 07:43.240
Little girl, don't be afraid.

07:43.770 --> 07:46.090
We met before. Do you remember?

07:48.549 --> 07:50.160
Why are you alone?

07:52.549 --> 07:55.006
They... They were sold.

07:55.030 --> 07:56.480
Sold?

07:57.070 --> 07:59.260
Don't be afraid. I'll get you out of here.

08:13.230 --> 08:14.680
Turn around.

08:31.060 --> 08:33.430
You know Swimming Dragon?

08:35.150 --> 08:37.270
You've got something.

08:37.970 --> 08:39.650
I'm curious

08:39.870 --> 08:41.990
how you got this poison.

08:42.059 --> 08:43.566
There's no point asking.

08:43.590 --> 08:46.036
As the name indicates, the poison will flow in your blood until you die.

08:46.060 --> 08:48.540
You'll be so painful that you want to me kill you quickly.

09:05.100 --> 09:07.230
A good rider falls off the horseback.

09:07.410 --> 09:09.440
A good swimmer drowns in water.

09:09.670 --> 09:11.940
Because they are careless and arrogant.

09:16.970 --> 09:19.010
You didn't touch me just now.

09:19.590 --> 09:21.040
Is that so?

09:37.100 --> 09:38.760
Red Dragon.

09:39.390 --> 09:40.930
Who are you?

09:41.360 --> 09:43.566
Since you know a lot about Dragon series poison,

09:43.590 --> 09:46.920
you know Red Dragon has different effects on different people.

09:47.230 --> 09:49.630
This poison can kill people in thousands of different ways.

09:50.170 --> 09:54.130
I think your liver will be melted

09:54.290 --> 09:56.290
and you'll bleed to death.

10:03.900 --> 10:05.350
The antidote.

10:05.630 --> 10:07.080
Let's exchange.

10:07.870 --> 10:09.320
Okay.

10:14.310 --> 10:15.726
Don't play any tricks.

10:15.750 --> 10:17.780
I have many ways to deal with you.

10:41.230 --> 10:42.196
Tell me.

10:42.220 --> 10:44.030
Who did you sell the kids to?

10:46.950 --> 10:49.286
To do such business, the buyers are careful.

10:49.310 --> 10:51.156
They will not reveal their names.

10:51.180 --> 10:52.426
I care about the money.

10:52.450 --> 10:53.980
I'm not interested in their names.

10:59.380 --> 11:01.420
Monster.

11:10.950 --> 11:12.276
I asked you not to kill her.

11:12.300 --> 11:13.406
I've asked her about the information we want.

11:13.430 --> 11:14.880
She's useless now.

11:17.990 --> 11:19.440
Little girl.

11:22.460 --> 11:23.656
It's my fault.

11:23.680 --> 11:25.130
I'm too late.

11:25.620 --> 11:27.070
Xiaoyu.

11:36.190 --> 11:37.640
Xiaoyu.

11:37.710 --> 11:38.956
It'll hurt.

11:38.980 --> 11:40.430
We are almost done.

11:46.590 --> 11:48.040
It's done.

11:49.060 --> 11:50.710
Give me your hand.

12:02.420 --> 12:03.870
Bear with it.

12:05.670 --> 12:07.816
Xiaoyu, look. Candied haws.

12:07.840 --> 12:08.676
They are sweet.

12:08.700 --> 12:10.150
These are for you.

12:19.590 --> 12:21.040
Xiaoyu.

12:21.430 --> 12:23.510
If it hurts, you can pinch me.

12:23.750 --> 12:26.270
You can cry or make a scene. Don't hold it in.

12:30.580 --> 12:32.030
Xiaoyu.

12:32.350 --> 12:33.666
This is the last time.

12:33.690 --> 12:35.250
No one will hurt you anymore.

12:36.560 --> 12:38.166
It doesn't hurt.

12:38.190 --> 12:40.060
I'm not afraid.

12:45.420 --> 12:47.060
According to Mrs. Jia,

12:47.140 --> 12:49.966
people go to Jishan Hall to buy children every month.

12:49.990 --> 12:50.966
Girls are sold to be underage prostitutes,

12:50.990 --> 12:52.566
and boys, servants.

12:52.590 --> 12:53.470
Xiaoyu wasn't sold

12:53.470 --> 12:56.100
probably because she hasn't fully recovered.

12:57.070 --> 12:58.966
But where did those kids go?

12:58.990 --> 13:00.756
I told you not to kill her.

13:00.780 --> 13:02.906
She probably didn't know.

13:02.930 --> 13:04.940
But since people bought kids from Jishan Hall regularly,

13:05.310 --> 13:07.806
there must be a whole chain.

13:07.830 --> 13:09.086
With a number of people involved.

13:09.110 --> 13:11.110
It shouldn't be difficult to find clues.

13:30.990 --> 13:32.046
Yun,

13:32.070 --> 13:33.750
do you have any plans?

13:35.630 --> 13:37.080
Not yet.

13:51.830 --> 13:53.830
You ate them all?

13:55.190 --> 13:57.150
You like candied haws so much?

13:57.350 --> 13:59.360
You can ask Brother Mingyu to buy more for you.

13:59.770 --> 14:01.220
Xiaoyu.

14:02.470 --> 14:03.920
Uncle Jin.

14:07.910 --> 14:09.390
Are candied haws delicious?

14:10.110 --> 14:10.906
What else do you want?

14:10.930 --> 14:12.390
I'll buy it for you.

14:13.160 --> 14:14.036
It's late.

14:14.060 --> 14:15.940
To sleep well, she shouldn't eat too much.

14:17.100 --> 14:18.726
I'm full.

14:18.750 --> 14:20.016
Really?

14:20.040 --> 14:22.020
Okay, let's eat tomorrow.

14:25.030 --> 14:27.416
Uncle Jin, your stubble is hard.

14:27.440 --> 14:28.890
Is it?

14:37.650 --> 14:39.370
What's wrong, Xiaoyu?

14:40.180 --> 14:42.310
I miss my father.

14:48.870 --> 14:50.350
Don't be afraid, Xiaoyu.

14:51.460 --> 14:53.530
I will protect you.

14:59.000 --> 15:01.616
My father taught me to sing a nursery rhyme.

15:01.640 --> 15:03.566
He said I can sing it when I miss him.

15:03.590 --> 15:05.630
I'll sing it for you.

15:06.220 --> 15:07.670
Okay.

15:18.690 --> 15:25.160
♫ Even if it's just a humble house ♫

15:25.460 --> 15:31.996
♫ We are happy with it ♫

15:32.020 --> 15:38.636
♫ Clothes made of cotton ♫

15:38.660 --> 15:41.690
♫ Are warmer than those made of silk ♫

15:42.070 --> 15:45.350
♫ Be they long or short ♫

15:47.690 --> 15:48.436
Be good, Xiaoyu.

15:48.460 --> 15:49.866
Stop singing.

15:49.890 --> 15:52.286
It's late. Go to bed.

15:52.310 --> 15:53.760
Here.

15:57.110 --> 15:58.556
Jin.

15:58.580 --> 16:00.030
Tomorrow morning,

16:00.300 --> 16:02.096
I'll ask my connections in the government

16:02.120 --> 16:03.800
to help find out where the kids are.

16:05.080 --> 16:07.290
Remember to copy all the account booksbooks

16:07.310 --> 16:08.146
of Jishan Hall.

16:08.170 --> 16:09.620
I'll take a look.

16:11.710 --> 16:15.230
Maybe I can find some clues about the human traffickers.

16:19.230 --> 16:20.680
Thank you.

16:38.230 --> 16:42.750
Jin looks fierce.

16:42.990 --> 16:45.046
But it turns out that he's very gentle.

16:45.070 --> 16:46.670
I didn't think so when we first met.

16:46.830 --> 16:48.660
Now I've realized

16:48.710 --> 16:51.376
Jin is a tough warrior with a tender heart.

16:51.400 --> 16:53.120
I'm both brave and considerate.

16:53.470 --> 16:55.140
You are the same kind of people.

16:58.290 --> 17:00.750
[Guanghui Bank]

16:58.390 --> 17:01.246
All cargo ships owned by Cao Sect are on hold.

17:01.270 --> 17:03.566
A number of sects are colluding.

17:03.590 --> 17:05.016
The Tang family even sent five large boxes of silver

17:05.040 --> 17:06.670
to Cao Sect's headquarters.

17:10.209 --> 17:11.670
Did you find out

17:12.110 --> 17:13.536
who set the fire?

17:13.560 --> 17:14.916
We've been investigating.

17:14.940 --> 17:16.510
But we don't have a clue.

17:16.830 --> 17:19.190
All right, you may leave.

17:19.290 --> 17:20.740
Yes.

17:21.110 --> 17:22.560
Wait.

17:24.430 --> 17:26.416
The three of your subordinates took an order

17:26.440 --> 17:27.616
to kill Jin Biao without our permission.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.406
Do you know that?

17:28.430 --> 17:29.880
Jin Biao?

17:30.310 --> 17:31.786
The swordsman together with Yun Xiang?

17:31.810 --> 17:33.260
Yes.

17:33.530 --> 17:35.016
Jin Biao is a martial arts ace.

17:35.040 --> 17:36.016
Only one of the three survived.

17:36.040 --> 17:37.256
And he's seriously injured.

17:37.280 --> 17:38.486
This is a result of my lax supervision.

17:38.510 --> 17:39.806
It's my fault.

17:39.830 --> 17:41.790
I'll kill him so that no one can find out.

17:41.810 --> 17:42.090
You...

17:42.110 --> 17:43.560
Bastard!

17:50.430 --> 17:54.760
Those people are your men.

17:58.930 --> 18:00.700
Just keep an eye on him.

18:01.030 --> 18:03.126
Take care of the funeral of those two.

18:03.150 --> 18:04.476
Also,

18:04.500 --> 18:06.806
this matter rests here.

18:06.830 --> 18:08.280
Don't mention it again.

18:08.350 --> 18:09.176
Yes.

18:09.200 --> 18:10.650
You may leave.

18:14.850 --> 18:17.290
Master, you've tasted at least a hundred kinds of tea.

18:17.620 --> 18:21.560
The tea tree on the hill is still your favorite.

18:23.110 --> 18:25.310
Tell me about the raw silk.

18:26.620 --> 18:29.480
The silk price has risen to five taels per catty.

18:29.750 --> 18:31.360
It's estimated

18:31.540 --> 18:33.290
the price will double tomorrow.

18:33.490 --> 18:37.050
We spent 8,000 taels to buy in silk today.

18:37.180 --> 18:38.526
But even so,

18:38.550 --> 18:41.500
we still don't have enough inventory.

18:43.120 --> 18:45.710
The 15,000 taels sent by Mr. Tang

18:45.820 --> 18:47.400
will run out soon.

18:47.920 --> 18:49.796
Maybe it will be used up tomorrow.

18:49.820 --> 18:51.280
I know it clearly.

18:52.270 --> 18:53.526
Master,

18:53.550 --> 18:55.430
I've been with you for so many years.

18:56.300 --> 18:59.900
You've never done such business.

19:00.190 --> 19:02.070
Someone from Yuntai is coming.

19:02.390 --> 19:03.950
I have no choice.

19:04.550 --> 19:06.000
I have to take the risk.

19:06.420 --> 19:07.870
Ding Yi,

19:08.190 --> 19:11.810
we can't afford to miss this opportunity.

19:11.910 --> 19:13.980
If we can defeat the Su family

19:14.220 --> 19:16.510
and dominate the business world in Nandu,

19:17.070 --> 19:19.550
Yuntai will be warier of us.

19:20.340 --> 19:22.280
The Tang family will also restrain themselves.

19:23.360 --> 19:26.446
But the Su family is illustrious, notable,

19:26.470 --> 19:28.066
and wealthy.

19:28.090 --> 19:29.770
It's not that easy

19:29.920 --> 19:31.400
to deal with them.

19:33.030 --> 19:34.670
Just wait.

19:35.700 --> 19:37.310
Just like this tea.

19:38.070 --> 19:39.246
Drink slowly.

19:39.270 --> 19:40.606
Only after three brews,

19:40.630 --> 19:44.170
can its true flavor be revealed.

19:46.870 --> 19:48.606
The three shadowmen

19:48.630 --> 19:49.816
didn't know

19:49.840 --> 19:52.510
what dirty business Jishan Hall did.

19:53.590 --> 19:54.966
Take this as a lesson

19:54.990 --> 19:56.866
and lay down strict rules.

19:56.890 --> 19:58.350
Of course.

19:58.670 --> 20:01.010
But I'm worried that...

20:02.060 --> 20:05.106
According to sect rules, we can't recruit secret soldiers without permission.

20:05.130 --> 20:06.526
And now Master is in Nandu.

20:06.550 --> 20:08.000
Are you worried

20:08.120 --> 20:10.220
Yun Xiang will report us to Master?

20:10.910 --> 20:12.266
I don't know.

20:12.290 --> 20:15.130
After all, even you can't see through him.

20:16.780 --> 20:18.406
You don't need to see through everyone.

20:18.430 --> 20:19.796
You just need to remember

20:19.820 --> 20:22.140
everyone is profit-orientated.

20:23.240 --> 20:24.970
If he turns me in,

20:25.280 --> 20:26.850
what benefits can he get?

20:45.270 --> 20:45.870
Why can't the Chamber of Commerce in Nandu

20:45.870 --> 20:47.456
be controlled by Nandu's businessmen?

20:47.480 --> 20:49.280
Why does it have to be Wen Cong?

20:51.420 --> 20:53.526
Uncle Jin, come and get me!

20:53.550 --> 20:55.640
Give it to me.

20:56.400 --> 20:58.660
Come and get me.

21:00.410 --> 21:01.646
Give it to me!

21:01.670 --> 21:03.310
Come and get me.

21:03.310 --> 21:04.596
I'm here!

21:04.620 --> 21:05.846
Come after me!

21:05.870 --> 21:08.920
Chase me!

21:10.270 --> 21:11.906
Give me the pinwheel.

21:11.930 --> 21:13.650
Give it to me.

21:30.550 --> 21:32.310
I'm teaching her how to throw darts.

21:32.580 --> 21:34.760
Why did you suddenly come out?

21:35.550 --> 21:37.660
She's just a kid. How can you teach her this?

21:40.950 --> 21:43.820
Don't go out. Play in the room.

21:47.710 --> 21:49.160
I...

21:51.600 --> 21:53.970
How would I know what to play with kids?

21:54.420 --> 21:56.396
Besides, what's wrong with teaching her this?

21:56.420 --> 21:57.950
She can learn to protect herself.

22:07.350 --> 22:09.070
What's wrong with you?

22:12.290 --> 22:14.280
The future of the Su family is hanging by a thread.

22:14.650 --> 22:15.646
Su Mingyu

22:15.670 --> 22:17.490
tackled the government

22:17.550 --> 22:19.310
just for what happened in Jishan Hall.

22:19.350 --> 22:21.030
That "Ten Taels of Gold" is not better.

22:21.280 --> 22:23.470
He has no foundation in Nandu.

22:23.760 --> 22:24.926
However, he insisted on

22:24.950 --> 22:27.230
looking for clues single-handedly.

22:28.430 --> 22:29.930
In addition,

22:30.550 --> 22:32.166
ever since I bought Liansheng House,

22:32.190 --> 22:34.340
no one has been taking good care of it.

22:39.110 --> 22:40.866
Xiaoyu gets along well with all of us.

22:40.890 --> 22:42.690
You are the only one she avoids.

22:42.720 --> 22:44.166
Have you ever thought about the reason?

22:44.190 --> 22:45.990
We are facing so many dangers now.

22:46.110 --> 22:47.966
How can I enjoy

22:47.990 --> 22:49.970
playing with a kid like you do?

22:53.150 --> 22:54.076
Sure enough,

22:54.100 --> 22:56.076
children have sharp eyes.

22:56.100 --> 22:58.270
They can tell who has a warm heart

22:58.680 --> 23:00.190
and who doesn't at a glance.

23:01.770 --> 23:03.606
I don't care

23:03.630 --> 23:05.080
how a kid thinks of me.

23:06.780 --> 23:10.680
The price of raw silk will increase to 5 taels per catty today.

23:10.760 --> 23:12.766
Most of the raw silk stocks in the city

23:12.790 --> 23:14.846
has been controlled by Qi Tianfeng.

23:14.870 --> 23:17.500
This is a life-or-death moment for the Su family.

23:17.900 --> 23:19.476
In such a troubled situation,

23:19.500 --> 23:21.556
it's okay if you don't want to help,

23:21.580 --> 23:23.830
but can you leave me alone?

23:29.870 --> 23:32.566
That ring looks ordinary to me,

23:32.590 --> 23:34.170
but you treasure it.

23:35.110 --> 23:37.530
You said those children had nothing to do with you,

23:37.990 --> 23:40.220
but they are precious to "Ten Taels of Gold".

23:40.870 --> 23:42.526
"Ten Taels of Gold" is anxious

23:42.550 --> 23:44.280
because he doesn't know where the kids are

23:44.710 --> 23:46.446
and what they are suffering from.

23:46.470 --> 23:48.726
Mr. Su is trying his best to help.

23:48.750 --> 23:50.340
What did they do wrong?

23:52.150 --> 23:55.160
I'm trying to reason with you, but you're talking about love with me.

23:55.590 --> 23:57.510
If there is only reason in the world,

23:57.980 --> 23:59.670
everything will be much simpler,

23:59.780 --> 24:02.450
but it's more boring as well.

24:02.750 --> 24:04.940
I heard people from Yuntai

24:05.240 --> 24:07.560
don't engage in love or hatred.

24:08.250 --> 24:11.036
But if you don't know hatred, how can you love?

24:11.060 --> 24:12.226
If you don't know love,

24:12.250 --> 24:14.370
what's the meaning of living?

24:14.750 --> 24:17.140
I don't know why Godfather saved you.

24:17.670 --> 24:21.790
But I'm sure part of that reason is sympathy.

24:23.590 --> 24:25.040
Dad.

24:25.350 --> 24:26.800
Dad!

24:27.560 --> 24:29.280
What's wrong with you, Dad?

24:29.350 --> 24:30.800
Dad!

24:34.040 --> 24:35.760
What's wrong with you, Dad?

24:35.910 --> 24:37.360
Dad.

24:41.270 --> 24:44.660
If you're done, please leave.

24:45.390 --> 24:46.910
I'm not finished.

24:47.190 --> 24:51.230
I don't believe you don't feel sorry for the kids at all.

24:52.790 --> 24:54.940
You've been restless since last night.

24:55.300 --> 24:57.570
You watched the iron hook for a long time.

24:58.170 --> 25:01.040
What's the secret behind it?

25:22.480 --> 25:24.680
It's Guanghui Bank.

25:30.430 --> 25:32.266
Why didn't you tell Jin Biao

25:32.290 --> 25:34.130
such an important clue?

25:34.440 --> 25:35.646
You know his personality.

25:35.670 --> 25:36.946
If he knows,

25:36.970 --> 25:38.950
he will definitely storm into Guanghui Bank.

25:39.220 --> 25:41.236
But Kang Qiao and Jin Biao

25:41.260 --> 25:42.756
are neck and neck.

25:42.780 --> 25:44.566
If I join hands with him against Kang Qiao,

25:44.590 --> 25:46.086
we might have a chance of winning.

25:46.110 --> 25:47.786
Do I have to arm wrestle you

25:47.810 --> 25:49.690
to remind you of your condition?

25:52.630 --> 25:53.926
Maybe I'm no match for Kang Qiao.

25:53.950 --> 25:54.876
But I can deal with you

25:54.900 --> 25:57.140
even if I'm not doing well.

25:58.110 --> 25:59.590
I underestimated you.

26:01.510 --> 26:03.550
Can't you show me some mercy?

26:04.100 --> 26:05.466
Considering how much I don't like you,

26:05.490 --> 26:07.160
that's not an option.

26:07.720 --> 26:11.740
Actually, if "Ten Taels of Gold" finds out the truth,

26:11.830 --> 26:14.166
it will give me an advantage.

26:14.190 --> 26:17.566
If I tell him the truth now, will you think I'm cruel?

26:17.590 --> 26:18.646
What do you mean?

26:18.670 --> 26:21.666
Maybe Mo Bufan did it on purpose,

26:21.690 --> 26:23.400
or maybe it's a misunderstanding.

26:23.970 --> 26:26.486
Whatever the truth is, he must be waiting for me

26:26.510 --> 26:28.250
to question him.

26:28.310 --> 26:30.496
If I let "Ten Taels of Gold" confront him first,

26:30.520 --> 26:32.596
Mo Bufan will feel in the wrong.

26:32.620 --> 26:34.620
Then it'd be easier to make him at my disposal.

26:37.590 --> 26:39.150
As you said,

26:39.310 --> 26:41.510
you didn't tell Jin for his own good.

26:43.380 --> 26:45.886
If you mean what you say,

26:45.910 --> 26:48.410
you still have a conscience.

26:48.690 --> 26:50.930
I just want to wait a little longer.

26:51.750 --> 26:53.820
When everyone is in panic,

26:54.270 --> 26:56.030
the tide will turn in favor of me.

26:56.190 --> 26:57.646
By then, you and Jin

26:57.670 --> 26:59.496
can smash Guanghui Bank.

26:59.520 --> 27:01.126
Then I'll step in to mediate,

27:01.150 --> 27:02.846
forcing Mo Bufan to join my side.

27:02.870 --> 27:04.410
What do you think of my plan?

27:04.870 --> 27:06.830
I touched your hand just now. It felt warm.

27:07.140 --> 27:08.766
I guess it's my illusion.

27:08.790 --> 27:11.740
Your heart is as cold as ice.

27:12.870 --> 27:14.386
Have you seen Xiaoyu's injuries?

27:14.410 --> 27:15.086
Have you ever thought about

27:15.110 --> 27:16.966
how miserable those missing children would be?

27:16.990 --> 27:19.650
Do you know what it means to waste one more day?

27:23.470 --> 27:25.760
She has suffered for so long.

27:25.980 --> 27:27.490
It won't be any worse

27:28.110 --> 27:29.610
if she waits longer.

27:45.550 --> 27:47.000
Yun Xiang.

27:47.900 --> 27:49.556
You fought with your senior.

27:49.580 --> 27:51.326
That's against sect rules.

27:51.350 --> 27:54.086
Is that what all these years of hard cultivation taught you to do?

27:54.110 --> 27:55.560
He took my thing.

27:56.120 --> 27:58.646
People in Yuntai

27:58.670 --> 28:00.326
rely on their wisdom.

28:00.350 --> 28:03.360
Every tangible thing dies.

28:03.870 --> 28:05.606
I want to know

28:05.630 --> 28:07.960
what you are trapped in.

28:09.150 --> 28:10.670
It's just an ornament.

28:10.860 --> 28:12.126
It's just I've been wearing it for a long time.

28:12.150 --> 28:14.270
Don't lie to me.

28:19.310 --> 28:21.110
It's the only thing

28:23.550 --> 28:24.806
my father left to me.

28:24.830 --> 28:26.590
Destroy it.

28:26.700 --> 28:28.160
Destroy it?

28:29.810 --> 28:31.380
I won't unless I die.

28:31.830 --> 28:33.496
If you can let go of your obsession,

28:33.520 --> 28:35.326
you'll be at peace with yourself.

28:35.350 --> 28:38.380
It's a taboo for people of Yuntai

28:38.590 --> 28:40.806
to have obsessions or be trapped in emotions.

28:40.830 --> 28:42.830
Are you going to disobey my order?

28:43.830 --> 28:46.720
If I expelled you from the sect because of this,

28:47.030 --> 28:49.606
your cultivation for years will be in vain.

28:49.630 --> 28:51.136
Will you regret it?

28:51.160 --> 28:52.610
No.

28:52.770 --> 28:55.530
Your worry deflects you from the truth.

28:55.670 --> 28:57.120
Your obsession

28:57.910 --> 29:00.460
will be your Achilles' heel.

29:05.980 --> 29:07.810
[Everlasting Honor of Ancestors]

29:25.430 --> 29:26.880
Young Master.

29:27.740 --> 29:28.456
Qian.

29:28.480 --> 29:30.200
When did you come back?

29:31.190 --> 29:32.426
I felt uneasy.

29:32.450 --> 29:35.180
But I dare not disturb my sister.

29:36.070 --> 29:38.630
That's very considerate of you.

29:40.440 --> 29:41.746
Qian.

29:41.770 --> 29:42.596
Are caravans on their way?

29:42.620 --> 29:44.086
According to Chairman Su's order,

29:44.110 --> 29:46.920
they were divided into 11 teams.

29:47.160 --> 29:49.400
They would take the land route, escorted.

29:50.260 --> 29:53.550
[Silk Escorts]

30:06.910 --> 30:08.226
Ancestors,

30:08.250 --> 30:11.930
bless the Su family to soldier on.

31:11.200 --> 31:15.850
[Two days later]

31:19.590 --> 31:21.040
Slow down.

31:22.770 --> 31:24.220
Give it to me.

31:27.090 --> 31:28.540
Here.

31:31.110 --> 31:32.560
Take it.

31:34.300 --> 31:35.750
Young Master,

31:36.260 --> 31:38.380
are you going to sell

31:38.410 --> 31:39.766
all the raw silk?

31:39.790 --> 31:42.080
Yes, all of it.

31:44.750 --> 31:47.016
This time, all 11 escorted teams

31:47.040 --> 31:48.920
were attacked.

31:49.350 --> 31:52.660
Less than two-tenths of the raw silk got here.

31:53.570 --> 31:55.016
The raw silk we have now

31:55.040 --> 31:56.276
is not enough

31:56.300 --> 31:58.430
for our own production.

31:59.100 --> 32:00.406
Qian,

32:00.430 --> 32:02.480
I have my reasons.

32:06.630 --> 32:08.080
How about this?

32:08.130 --> 32:11.290
We should let your sister decide.

32:12.230 --> 32:13.406
Although we don't have much raw silk,

32:13.430 --> 32:14.726
it's enough to make tribute cloth.

32:14.750 --> 32:15.550
That can also

32:15.550 --> 32:17.166
solve our urgent problem.

32:17.190 --> 32:18.076
Qian, the tribute cloth

32:18.100 --> 32:20.086
isn't our most urgent problem now.

32:20.110 --> 32:21.126
Our priority is to maintain our status

32:21.150 --> 32:23.810
in the Chamber of Commerce.

32:26.350 --> 32:27.726
Sister, are we still in touch with

32:27.750 --> 32:30.340
Eunuch Liu of the Textile Department?

32:31.490 --> 32:32.526
That's great.

32:32.550 --> 32:33.486
Eunuch Liu

32:33.510 --> 32:35.566
has always been very close to us.

32:35.590 --> 32:37.056
If he can help us,

32:37.080 --> 32:39.606
we can deliver

32:39.630 --> 32:41.080
the tribute cloth later.

32:41.890 --> 32:45.246
Eunuch Liu can help us with the tribute cloth

32:45.270 --> 32:47.086
but he can't control the silk market in Nandu.

32:47.110 --> 32:49.436
There are many people in the Nandu business world

32:49.460 --> 32:51.046
coveting the position of chairman.

32:51.070 --> 32:53.676
If we can't lower the silk price

32:53.700 --> 32:55.380
and fail to stabilize the silk market,

32:56.630 --> 32:59.500
sister, you are to blame.

33:00.150 --> 33:02.726
Then, you'll lose the position of chairman

33:02.750 --> 33:04.366
and the Su family's reputation will be greatly damaged.

33:04.390 --> 33:08.030
Could we still be a royal supplier by then?

33:10.510 --> 33:11.960
Sister, Qian,

33:12.840 --> 33:14.326
you should know

33:14.350 --> 33:15.406
what you are doing

33:15.430 --> 33:18.110
and prioritize the problems we are facing.

33:19.200 --> 33:20.650
Let me ask you.

33:21.790 --> 33:23.386
How can we lower the silk price

33:23.410 --> 33:25.490
with just more than ten carts of raw silk?

33:26.070 --> 33:27.520
Well...

33:32.550 --> 33:34.000
This...

33:34.220 --> 33:35.906
Your sister will ask

33:35.930 --> 33:37.576
how to use this small amount of raw silk

33:37.600 --> 33:39.046
to lower the silk price.

33:39.070 --> 33:40.416
Then your answer should be

33:40.440 --> 33:42.296
in the name of the Chamber of Commerce...

33:42.320 --> 33:43.656
Yes.

33:43.680 --> 33:45.566
We can sell raw silk at a low price

33:45.590 --> 33:47.276
in the name of the Chamber of Commerce.

33:47.300 --> 33:48.486
In this way,

33:48.510 --> 33:50.896
we can stop the price of raw silk from rising.

33:50.920 --> 33:52.236
Also, people can see

33:52.260 --> 33:54.980
you have

33:55.770 --> 33:56.876
a strong sense of responsibility.

33:56.900 --> 33:58.796
Anyway, making tribute cloth

33:58.820 --> 34:00.846
is an effectual...

34:00.870 --> 34:01.350
No.

34:01.370 --> 34:03.756
Making tribute cloth is an ineffectual remedy.

34:03.780 --> 34:06.610
To reduce silk prices is to move the needle.

34:12.150 --> 34:13.600
What's wrong?

34:20.950 --> 34:21.795
Sister,

34:21.819 --> 34:24.780
you and Qian don't have to avoid me.

34:24.900 --> 34:27.706
You're already deeply in love.

34:27.730 --> 34:29.459
How can you hide it?

34:29.900 --> 34:31.295
Life is short.

34:31.319 --> 34:33.056
Time flies by.

34:33.080 --> 34:35.550
You don't have to hide it.

34:35.750 --> 34:38.076
Besides, there are only you and me in the Su family.

34:38.100 --> 34:41.320
I consider Qian as a family member.

34:43.470 --> 34:44.950
Did Mr. Yun

34:45.830 --> 34:47.880
teach you this?

34:51.609 --> 34:52.826
Sister.

34:52.850 --> 34:55.486
Does it matter?

34:55.510 --> 34:57.570
Do you think it makes sense too?

34:59.670 --> 35:01.120
Rong,

35:03.660 --> 35:07.390
invite Mr. Yun over

35:07.510 --> 35:10.226
with the highest courtesy.

35:10.250 --> 35:12.410
Okay, I'll do it now.

35:18.310 --> 35:19.760
Mingyu.

35:20.440 --> 35:21.890
Sister.

35:22.180 --> 35:23.646
We have time today.

35:23.670 --> 35:25.990
Why don't you talk with me

35:26.330 --> 35:27.880
about Miss Ke?

36:13.710 --> 36:15.160
Mr. Yun.

36:23.200 --> 36:24.650
Han Xizai.

36:24.850 --> 36:26.390
A masterpiece dating back to the Southern Tang.

36:27.510 --> 36:29.630
I didn't expect it to be in the Su family.

36:30.670 --> 36:32.500
Some people think the story behind the painting is like this.

36:35.080 --> 36:36.610
When the Southern Tang was in decline,

36:37.060 --> 36:40.690
Emperor Li Yun ordered the imperial painter to sneak into Han Xizai's house.

36:40.750 --> 36:42.650
He wanted to see

36:42.790 --> 36:44.636
if the man he intended to appoint as Prime Minister

36:44.660 --> 36:46.930
was really prodigal

36:47.560 --> 36:49.370
and unrestrained

36:49.630 --> 36:51.180
as rumors said.

36:51.430 --> 36:53.390
The painter's skills were excellent.

36:53.950 --> 36:55.840
The painter portrayed the banquet vividly.

36:56.740 --> 36:59.196
The emperor must have seen

36:59.220 --> 37:02.330
Han Xizai indeed led a life of debauchery

37:02.660 --> 37:04.170
and he was not an aspiring man.

37:04.470 --> 37:07.970
Thus, the emperor didn't make Han Xizai an official.

37:08.190 --> 37:11.990
But if you look carefully,

37:12.810 --> 37:14.396
you can see that Han Xizai sat there alone

37:14.420 --> 37:16.196
when others were singing and dancing.

37:16.220 --> 37:18.070
He was frowning.

37:18.120 --> 37:21.026
Maybe the emperor saw

37:21.050 --> 37:23.470
how hedonistic Han Xizai was.

37:23.550 --> 37:26.870
Or, he actually understood Han Xizai's true purpose but didn't point it out.

37:27.040 --> 37:28.850
What do you think?

37:33.610 --> 37:36.636
I think this person is quite interesting.

37:36.660 --> 37:39.630
Han Xizai was sitting by himself at this boisterous banquet.

37:40.550 --> 37:42.500
He was the only one with a sober mind.

37:42.870 --> 37:46.840
Then this monk seems to have entered the secular world by mistake.

37:47.030 --> 37:48.980
He and Han Xizai were best friends.

37:49.030 --> 37:50.916
He knew Han Xizai was ambitious

37:50.940 --> 37:52.410
but Han couldn't realize his aspirations.

37:52.790 --> 37:54.690
Therefore, Han Xizai could only indulge in wine

37:54.820 --> 37:56.270
for the rest of his life.

37:57.380 --> 38:00.690
The sigh of the monk could be heard clearly

38:00.950 --> 38:02.400
even after hundreds of years.

38:02.830 --> 38:04.750
The person with the most acute observation

38:04.950 --> 38:08.050
should be the imperial painter.

38:08.160 --> 38:10.470
It's not difficult to draw people's posture.

38:10.710 --> 38:14.226
But he understood what was behind the posture.

38:14.250 --> 38:17.826
No matter how brilliant the painter was,

38:17.850 --> 38:20.980
he wouldn't know that after dynasties,

38:21.930 --> 38:25.560
someone would

38:25.940 --> 38:27.990
examine his work so carefully.

38:28.430 --> 38:31.740
In this chaotic world, it's difficult to see things clearly.

38:32.350 --> 38:34.890
In fact, you already knew

38:34.990 --> 38:37.046
this isn't Gu Hongzhong's original work.

38:37.070 --> 38:39.840
But you didn't point it out.

38:40.910 --> 38:42.496
The world is chaotic.

38:42.520 --> 38:44.526
Why bother to distinguish the true

38:44.550 --> 38:46.150
from the false?

38:46.810 --> 38:48.310
Just like this painting.

38:48.610 --> 38:50.060
It may not be useful.

38:50.590 --> 38:52.760
It's silent

38:53.440 --> 38:55.950
but it's far better than the noise outside.

38:56.650 --> 38:58.606
Mr. Yun,

38:58.630 --> 39:00.440
unlike Han Xizai,

39:00.510 --> 39:03.136
the Su family has many friends

39:03.160 --> 39:04.640
and we are exactly what we appear to be.

39:04.930 --> 39:07.236
We treat our friends

39:07.260 --> 39:10.740
sincerely.

39:12.820 --> 39:14.630
Since I'm here,

39:15.390 --> 39:17.270
I know it clearly.

39:22.300 --> 39:28.800
[High Quality Raw Silk, 2 Taels per Catty]

39:22.740 --> 39:23.886
Everybody,

39:23.910 --> 39:25.926
the raw silk for today is sold out.

39:25.950 --> 39:27.026
I'm really sorry.

39:27.050 --> 39:28.436
Sold out?

39:28.460 --> 39:29.506
Do you have more tomorrow?

39:29.530 --> 39:30.886
Everyone,

39:30.910 --> 39:31.776
recently the price of raw silk in Nandu

39:31.800 --> 39:34.726
has soared to 6 taels per catty.

39:34.750 --> 39:36.326
Six taels!

39:36.350 --> 39:38.486
So if you want to buy

39:38.510 --> 39:40.150
cheap raw silk,

39:40.350 --> 39:42.606
why don't you come in

39:42.630 --> 39:44.126
to learn what the Su family's plan is?

39:44.150 --> 39:45.136
Okay?

39:45.160 --> 39:45.696
Okay.

39:45.720 --> 39:47.170
Let's go.

39:47.490 --> 39:49.486
Thank you for coming.

39:49.510 --> 39:51.876
I'm truly grateful.

39:51.900 --> 39:53.006
Mr. Su,

39:53.030 --> 39:55.670
we are here today for raw silk.

39:55.830 --> 39:56.846
Yes.

39:56.870 --> 39:58.526
Business is business.

39:58.550 --> 40:01.006
Just tell us how much raw silk you have

40:01.030 --> 40:02.476
and what's the price.

40:02.500 --> 40:03.926
To be honest,

40:03.950 --> 40:07.510
the Su family's silk is already sold out.

40:08.560 --> 40:09.246
Sold out?

40:09.270 --> 40:10.626
Why are we here then?

40:10.650 --> 40:11.736
Let's go.

40:11.760 --> 40:12.646
Let's go.

40:12.670 --> 40:13.876
Let's go.

40:13.900 --> 40:15.350
Let's go.

40:16.750 --> 40:18.230
Please wait.

40:18.750 --> 40:20.630
Although we have no more inventory,

40:20.670 --> 40:23.886
we'll keep selling the raw silk of the Chamber of Commerce

40:23.910 --> 40:26.690
at the price of two taels per catty.

40:26.940 --> 40:28.406
What does this mean?

40:28.430 --> 40:30.950
He doesn't have any raw silk but he'll keep selling at the price of two taels per catty?

40:32.240 --> 40:33.186
Let's listen to his explanation.

40:33.210 --> 40:35.160
What's going on?

40:39.120 --> 40:40.570
Everyone,

40:41.890 --> 40:43.770
this is the deed endorsed by the Chamber of Commerce,

40:43.870 --> 40:47.326
stipulating that the Su family

40:47.350 --> 40:50.006
will sell its raw silk at 2 taels per catty.

40:50.030 --> 40:51.510
There are 80,000 catties in total.

40:51.750 --> 40:53.700
We'll deliver the order in 15 days.

40:53.920 --> 40:55.006
Of course,

40:55.030 --> 40:57.596
if we can't deliver it in 15 days,

40:57.620 --> 41:00.126
we'll make compensation according to the silk price on that day.

41:00.090 --> 41:03.760
[Deed - Nandu Chamber of Commerce]

41:00.090 --> 41:03.810
[Two taels per catty. 80,000 catties in total. Promise to deliver in 15 days.]

41:00.150 --> 41:03.240
It's clearly written behind the deed.
